'''Passel Argente''' was a [[Gender|male]] [[Koorivar]] who was the [[Magistrate]] of the [[Corporate Alliance]] and a member of the [[Galactic Senate]] representing his [[homeworld]], [[Kooriva]], in the final days of the [[Galactic Republic]]. He pledged his forces to the [[Confederacy of Independent Systems]], and served on the [[Executive Separatist Council|Separatist Council]] until his [[death]] at the hands of [[Anakin Skywalker|Darth Vader]] on [[Mustafar]] at the culmination of the [[Clone Wars]].

==Biography==
A [[Gender|male]] [[Koorivar]] [[Homeworld|hailing]] from his [[species]]' [[planet]] of [[Kooriva]], Passel Argente joined the [[Corporate Alliance]], ultimately leading the group after winning the post of [[Magistrate]]. He also served in the [[Galactic Senate]] of the [[Galactic Republic|Republic]]<ref name="USW">''[[Ultimate Star Wars]]''</ref> as the [[senator]] of Kooriva.<ref name="Tarkin" /> Argente was among the senators who supported the [[Vote of No Confidence]] issued by [[Monarch of Naboo|Queen]] [[Padmé Amidala Naberrie|Padmé Amidala]] against the leadership of [[Supreme Chancellor]] [[Finis Valorum]], which led to Valorum's downfall and the election of [[Darth Sidious|Sheev Palpatine]] as his successor.<ref name="USW" /><ref name="TPM" />

Argente had made the acquaintance of [[Count]] [[Dooku]] by the time he had disaffiliated himself with the [[Jedi Order]], and was responsible for introducing him to [[Eriadu]] [[governor]] [[Wilhuff Tarkin]] while on [[Coruscant]].<ref name="Tarkin" /> Dooku was in the process of quietly amassing a coalition of industrial titans, including the Corporate Alliance's competitors in the [[Commerce Guild]];<ref name="Rise">''[[Rise of the Separatists]]''</ref> nevertheless, after Dooku reemerged as the [[Head of State|head]] of the [[Separatist Crisis|Separatist movement]] some eight [[Standard year|years]] later, Argente was the first in the [[Galactic Senate]] to support what would become the [[Confederacy of Independent Systems]], giving confidence to other senators to support Dooku.<ref name="Tarkin" />

In [[22 BBY]], Argente and other heads of corporation met with Dooku on [[Geonosis]] to discuss a [[Geonosian accord|treaty]] proposed by the Count. Dooku, rallying forces to create his Confederacy, hoped to gain the support of the Corporate Alliance, although [[First Battle of Geonosis|attacks]] by [[Jedi]] and the [[Grand Army of the Republic]] led to the outbreak of the [[Clone Wars]] on Geonosis.<ref name="AOTC" /> Argente resigned his senatorial office and joined Dooku's cause, becoming a member of the [[Executive Separatist Council|Separatist Council]]<ref name="USW" /> after pledging the Corporate Alliance's forces to the Separatist Alliance.<ref name="Corporate Alliance Databank">{{Databank|corporate-alliance|Corporate Alliance}}</ref> During the war, Passel Argente was in rivalry with fellow separatist [[Wat Tambor]]. When the latter discovered that the head of the Corporate Alliance had hidden his wealth on [[Ryloth]], the [[Skakoan]] made the [[Battle of Ryloth|invasion]] of the planet his priority.<ref name="Clone Wars Begin">{{EncyclopediaCite|The Clone Wars Begin}}</ref>

[[File:Mission-to-Mustafar.png|thumb|left|243px|Argente was killed with the rest of the Separatist Council by Darth Vader on Mustafar.]]
As the war came to its conclusion, Argente joined his fellow council members on [[Utapau]], and from there was sent to [[Mustafar]] by [[General]] [[Grievous]], Argente was stationed in the control room when [[Darth Sidious]] informed the Council that his new [[Sith apprentice|apprentice]], [[Anakin Skywalker|Darth Vader]] was on his way to take care of them. Once Vader entered the control room, he proceeded to [[Death|slaughter]] every member of the Council; As the [[Sith Lord]] cut his way through several [[aide]]s, including Argente's own personal aide [[Denaria Kee]], Argente attempted to flee but sustained a fatal blow to the neck region from [[Skywalker lightsaber|Vader's]] [[lightsaber]].<ref name="ROTS" />

==Equipment==
While on Geonosis, Argente wore a brown [[shimmerbird tongue robe]] with a crocheted [[Clothing|hood]] and the [[brooch of Luristan]].<ref name="VE">''[[Star Wars: The Visual Encyclopedia]]''</ref>

==Behind the scenes==
Passel Argente was played by [[Steven Boyle]] in the [[2002]] film [[Star Wars: Episode II Attack of the Clones|''Star Wars'': Episode II ''Attack of the Clones'']], the second installment of the ''[[Star Wars]]'' [[prequel trilogy]].<ref name="AOTC" /> He was then played by [[Marty Wetherill]] in the [[2005]] film [[Star Wars: Episode III Revenge of the Sith|''Star Wars'': Episode III ''Revenge of the Sith'']].<ref name="ROTS" />

